Phase 1: Core Engine (MVP)
├── Build auto-correct using dictionary + edit distance
├── Build next-word prediction using n-gram model
├── Desktop prototype (e.g., Python app or browser extension)
└── Local user dictionary for basic personalization

Phase 2: Smarter Models
├── Upgrade to small transformer for better predictions
├── Context-aware auto-correct (not just spell-check)
└── User behavior learning (typing patterns, common phrases)

Phase 3: Cross-Platform
├── Mobile keyboard (Android first, then iOS)
├── Shared prediction engine (Rust/C++ core)
└── Cloud sync for cross-device personalization

Phase 4: Advanced Features
├── Multi-language support
├── Sentence-level completion
├── Voice-to-text integration
└── Domain-specific modes